			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 740390701,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME}！{F#妳}{M#你}還好嗎？{F#妳}{M#你}還好嗎！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390702
					],
					"speakerTitle": "薇蕾娜妲"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390702,
					"content": "嗚…對不起、對不起…薇蕾娜妲不知道藥劑會引來怪東西…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390703,
						740390710
					],
					"speakerTitle": "薇蕾娜妲"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390703,
					"content": "因為藥劑讓我暖洋洋，所以會這樣。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390704
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740390704,
					"content": "欸…是這個原因嗎！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390705
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390705,
					"content": "#哇…對哦，因為水生動物會把暖洋洋的東西誤以為是太陽光，於是受它吸引。所以說…藥劑成功了！謝謝{F#妳}{M#你}！謝謝{F#妳}{M#你}們！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390706
					],
					"speakerTitle": "薇蕾娜妲"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390706,
					"content": "嗚哇…雖然我覺得不是這個理由…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390707
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390707,
					"content": "水生動物…？不是火史萊姆嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390708
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740390708,
					"content": "這樣嗎…嗯，致幻作用…好的，記下來了！也不是全無作用嘛…但是…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390709
					],
					"speakerTitle": "薇蕾娜妲"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390709,
					"content": "但是作用很不妙！今天把大螃蟹看成火史萊姆，明天如果是更危險的怪物怎麼辦呀！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390720
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390720,
					"content": "#嗯…薇蕾娜妲已經麻煩了{F#妳}{M#你}們好多好多，但還有最後一種藥需要實驗…那個，{F#妳}{M#你}們還願意嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390721,
						740390723
					],
					"speakerTitle": "薇蕾娜妲"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390721,
					"content": "只要沒有毒就可以。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390722
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740390722,
					"content": "有沒有毒也只能試出來吧…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390725
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390725,
					"content": "#嗯，謝謝{F#妳}{M#你}們！那麼接下來…就是「真視藥劑」，嗯！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390726
					],
					"speakerTitle": "薇蕾娜妲"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390726,
					"content": "欸？等等、等等！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390727
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390727,
					"content": "第一瓶是「超厲害藥水」，第二瓶叫「暖洋洋藥水」，然後這瓶叫做…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390728
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390728,
					"content": "「真視藥劑」，嗯，就是「能讓人看見真實」的意思…怎麼了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390729
					],
					"speakerTitle": "薇蕾娜妲"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390729,
					"content": "唔…沒什麼啦…就是覺得這個名字跟其他的相比，突然有了三百六十度的轉變耶。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390730,
						740390731
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390730,
					"content": "那不是和沒變一樣嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390732
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740390732,
					"content": "欸…？唔，我不知道啦！反正就是這個意思！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390733
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390733,
					"content": "嘿嘿，因為前兩個是藥劑師大人替薇蕾娜妲取的名字，「真視藥劑」是薇蕾娜妲自己取的…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390734
					],
					"speakerTitle": "薇蕾娜妲"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390734,
					"content": "薇蕾娜妲取的名字很笨，絕對是不如藥劑師大人的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390735
					],
					"speakerTitle": "薇蕾娜妲"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390735,
					"content": "這、這樣嗎…我還以為是反過來…不過妳要有自信一點啦！不如說這才像是正常藥劑該有的名字…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390736
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390736,
					"content": "嗯，謝謝。那個…這瓶藥劑和前兩例不同，可能會很危險…所以，來薇蕾娜妲的工棚吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390737
					],
					"speakerTitle": "薇蕾娜妲"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390737,
					"content": "嗯…如果是在海裡的話，環境應該可以中和藥效，而且工棚裡還有處理危險的工具，所以…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390738
					],
					"speakerTitle": "薇蕾娜妲"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390738,
					"content": "嗚哇…這次真的要試猛藥了耶…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390739
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390739,
					"content": "我們這就開始吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390740
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740390740,
					"content": "嗯，請隨我來！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "薇蕾娜妲"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390731,
					"content": "是一百八十度吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390732
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740390723,
					"content": "反正都已經到這一步了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390724
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740390724,
					"content": "對呀，半途而廢多讓人氣餒呀！唔…雖然我還是有點擔心就是了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390725
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390710,
					"content": "沒關係啦，火史萊姆很弱。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390711
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740390711,
					"content": "#哼哼，不對不對！明明是{NICKNAME}很強！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390712
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390712,
					"content": "#唔，不過等等…{F#妳}{M#你}剛剛說「火史萊姆」…？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390713
					],
					"speakerTitle": "薇蕾娜妲"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390713,
					"content": "對哦…明明我們只看見了好多螃蟹的說！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390714,
						740390716
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390714,
					"content": "螃蟹？嗯…海邊有螃蟹確實很正常。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390715
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740390715,
					"content": "#但{F#妳}{M#你}剛才很不正常！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390720
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390716,
					"content": "但燃燒的感覺很真實，甚至有熱浪…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390717
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740390717,
					"content": "這樣呀…嗯，致幻作用…好的，記下來了！雖然並非全無作用…但是…唉…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390718
					],
					"speakerTitle": "薇蕾娜妲"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390718,
					"content": "#不過{F#妳}{M#你}沒事就太好了！只是…薇蕾娜妲很對不起，藥劑又沒有成功…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390719
					],
					"speakerTitle": "薇蕾娜妲"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390719,
					"content": "#也沒關係啦，反正…嗯，雖然很難聞就是了，但其實也已經成功了一半了呀！妳看，{NICKNAME}喝完還是活蹦亂跳的唷！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390720
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7403908,
			"completionStepIds": [
				7403908
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
